{"date":"2022-01-20","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/b1/b6/305660_cp2pV.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/b1/b6/305660_cp2pV.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/b1/b6/305660_cp2pV.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/b1/b6/305660_cp2pV.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/b1/b6/305660_cp2pV.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上有一群人，他们身体上刻有文字“印”，并可以通过念力将“印”转化为超能力施放出来，这种能力被称为言能，而这群人被称为言能师。唯一能够教授这种能力知识的地方，是有着悠久历史，继承了远古文明的万象学城。每一年万象学城都会举办考试，招收有潜力的言能师进入学城学习，并将他们组建成维护世界和平的警卫力量——千从狩。我们的主人公千从虽是个有印无能的哑炮，却也梦想着成为最强的千从狩，并为此进入学城求学，开启了他的不灭人生。","name":"千从狩","name_cn":"千从狩","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":68,"total_count":159654},{"name":"原创","count":54,"total_count":612364},{"name":"热血","count":38,"total_count":210528},{"name":"三渲二","count":35,"total_count":491},{"name":"战斗","count":34,"total_count":463252},{"name":"绘梦","count":26,"total_count":2921},{"name":"中国","count":23,"total_count":31049},{"name":"2022","count":21,"total_count":79926},{"name":"2022年1月","count":18,"total_count":17589},{"name":"3D","count":14,"total_count":50753},{"name":"国漫","count":13,"total_count":15553},{"name":"WEB","count":11,"total_count":70807},{"name":"绘之刃","count":8,"total_count":9},{"name":"国创","count":8,"total_count":4164},{"name":"TV","count":4,"total_count":1389309},{"name":"中二","count":2,"total_count":9072},{"name":"奇幻","count":2,"total_count":461642},{"name":"少年向","count":2,"total_count":7147},{"name":"正常","count":2,"total_count":986},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35398},{"name":"7+","count":1,"total_count":573},{"name":"冒险","count":1,"total_count":52711},{"name":"绘之刃动画","count":1,"total_count":9},{"name":"2022年","count":1,"total_count":3430},{"name":"bilibili","count":1,"total_count":3478},{"name":"第二集打斗可后面偏平淡","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"常规热血少年番","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"碟中谍中碟","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"伏笔太多未填坑","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"七创社","count":1,"total_count